{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261006145929_5d70daa6","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_c11f0c3ad4be061f19506d84","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006145929_5d70daa6","chunk_index":1,"job_id":"mwjob_5f1bc3199964d95fa63f91f8","precondition_digest":"a152920577fe3f6cd0dd4d514ed3426624fe83e1be3d143cacd52d1c030f8204","project_id":"proj_user_a67458cd1359","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_bfdb1d48363307f8","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_3e7bde26e0a519bf","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_0a9bf55bb3163543","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_58e6f365ebb1dbdd"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006145929_5d70daa6","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照加活性对照的II期设计；KZ-PHN902每日两次口服，三组（100mg、200mg、普瑞巴林活性对照），治疗8周。","quote_sha256":"5ebd13070034ff83511bddb08013d85e08018c543059862255b76021107cc93e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"ES001"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"带状疱疹后神经痛（皮疹愈合后≥3个月，NRS≥4分），既往普瑞巴林/加巴喷丁疗效不佳或不耐受。","quote_sha256":"d9aa8380dbc963830b282c938c9ac7dda620878c99e565086170c2ffadd57ad4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"ES002"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"第8周24小时平均疼痛NRS评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"2cccf49c69e38309c6973a20f9e23f7e2e1a9d633499423657d1f91c27fd8850","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"ES003"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"第8周NRS较基线下降≥30%/≥50%应答率、睡眠干扰评分（NRS-SI）、PGIC。","quote_sha256":"13a73536ca6c50aaf3f4ce32197cd36081c39c224c4bddd90bb7dd1fa1defd6c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"ES004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"筛选2周；双盲治疗8周；安全随访2周。","quote_sha256":"73d0a6e68e6713d9221d46d2553c054e5aef58f096eb945bcd173ce881c59fd5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"ES005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"II期概念验证：三组各60例共180例；按NRS组间差1.0分、SD 2.0、α=0.05双侧、80%把握度探索性设定。","quote_sha256":"e62bfec01431121d019004bb3b3c086441b56253f1c4ff60718f4a1557690d02","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"ES006"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ES001","ES002","ES003","ES004","ES005","ES006"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"gap_items":[],"heading":"方案概要","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为KZ-PHN902（口服Nav1.7通道选择性阻滞剂片）用于治疗带状疱疹后神经痛的II期临床研究，采用多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照加活性对照的设计。研究设三个治疗组：KZ-PHN902 100mg每日两次口服组、KZ-PHN902 200mg每日两次口服组及普瑞巴林活性对照组（150mg起始，按耐受性滴定至300mg每日两次），三组按1:1:1随机分配，采用双盲双模拟方法。目标研究人群为18至80岁带状疱疹后神经痛患者（皮疹愈合后≥3个月，24小时平均疼痛NRS评分≥4分），既往接受至少一种一线镇痛方案（普瑞巴林、加巴喷丁或度洛西汀）疗效不佳或不耐受。研究时期包括筛选期2周、双盲治疗期8周及安全随访期2周。主要疗效终点为第8周24小时平均疼痛NRS评分较基线的变化；关键次要终点包括第8周NRS较基线下降≥30%和≥50%的应答率、睡眠干扰评分（NRS-SI）及患者总体印象变化（PGIC）。安全性评估涵盖不良事件（重点关注头晕、嗜睡、步态异常）、生命体征、心电图及实验室检查。访视安排为筛选、基线、第2周、第4周、第8周及安全随访访视，治疗期间通过电子疼痛日记每日记录NRS。样本量为三组各60例，共180例，按NRS组间差1.0分、标准差2.0、双侧α=0.05、80%把握度进行探索性设定。主要终点采用混合效应模型重复测量（MMRM）分析，以全分析集（FAS）为主分析集，KZ-PHN902两个剂量组与安慰剂组比较采用Holm法校正多重性，活性对照组进行描述性比较。估计目标采用治疗政策策略，急救对乙酰氨基酚不改变治疗归属，脱落受试者不替换，按意向性治疗原则纳入FAS。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实（方案编号MW-II-52581DA1-DRAFT，修订6）中的总体研究设计、目标人群、干预方案、终点、研究时期、访视策略、样本量及统计分析策略逐项写入。医学经理需核实：（1）普瑞巴林活性对照的滴定方案（150mg→300mg BID）是否为最终确认方案；（2）安全性终点中头晕、嗜睡、步态异常是否为已确认的AE关注类别；（3）双盲双模拟的具体实施细节（如安慰剂外观、匹配方式）是否需在方案正文中进一步描述。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（方案概要）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、估计目标、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_bfdb1d48363307f8","section_number":"1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:4e72f526af1f37fd2830b0d3","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006145929_5d70daa6","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"检索并上传带状疱疹后神经痛流行病学、疾病负担及现行诊疗指南来源","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP_001","missing_source_classes":["流行病学数据","疾病负担描述","诊疗指南","治疗现状文献"],"target":"疾病背景及治疗现状章节正文"}],"heading":"疾病背景及治疗现状","missing_source_classes":["流行病学数据","疾病负担描述","诊疗指南","治疗现状文献"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要带状疱疹后神经痛的流行病学数据（患病率、发病率、疾病负担）、现行诊疗指南（如中国或国际PHN管理指南）及当前治疗现状（一线/二线镇痛方案疗效局限性）等来源方可形成实质正文。当前允许来源中无上述内容，仅有章节标题及","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_3e7bde26e0a519bf","section_number":"2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:4e72f526af1f37fd2830b0d3","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006145929_5d70daa6","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"KZ-PHN902（口服Nav1.7通道选择性阻滞剂片）","quote_sha256":"02e5f818b7d89883662b7b680813774fde4ee5095335e9048af602f4516ee1b0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"ES008"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule\n给药途径：口服\n剂型：口服固体制剂\n局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"93d70823288385813f38b773b8c6e7bba227a7ed893796844d8834e9f3bae884","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"ES009"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ES008","ES009"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"上传KZ-PHN902研究者手册或IB摘要","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP_002","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","药代动力学/药效学数据","既往临床数据"],"target":"研究药物简介章节中PK/PD及既往临床数据段落"}],"heading":"研究药物简介","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","药代动力学/药效学数据","既往临床数据","非临床安全性数据"],"proposal_text":"KZ-PHN902为口服Nav1.7通道选择性阻滞剂片，属小分子化合物，以口服固体制剂形式给药，产生全身性暴露。本品通过选择性阻断Nav1.7电压门控钠通道，抑制伤害性感觉神经元中动作电位的产生与传导，从而减轻神经病理性疼痛信号传递。本研究拟评估KZ-PHN902 100mg和200mg每日两次口服给药8周在带状疱疹后神经痛患者中的疗效与安全性，并以普瑞巴林作为活性对照。","rationale":"本段依据已确认的项目研究事实写入药物名称、作用机制（Nav1.7通道选择性阻滞）、技术类型（small_molecule）、给药途径（口服）、剂型（口服固体制剂）及暴露范围（systemic）。医学经理需核实：（1）Nav1.7通道阻滞机制描述是否准确反映KZ-PHN902的药理学特征；（2）是否需补充药代动力学参数（如Tmax、半衰期、生物利用度）；（3）是否需引用既往临床数据或IB中的安全性摘要。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_0a9bf55bb3163543","section_number":"2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:4e72f526af1f37fd2830b0d3","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006145929_5d70daa6","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"上传KZ-PHN902非临床研究报告或IB中非临床数据章节","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP_003","missing_source_classes":["非临床药理学研究报告","毒理学研究报告","动物药代动力学数据","安全性药理学数据","研究者手册（IB）"],"target":"非临床研究结果章节全部正文"}],"heading":"非临床研究结果","missing_source_classes":["非临床药理学研究报告","毒理学研究报告","动物药代动力学数据","安全性药理学数据"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要KZ-PHN902的非临床药理学研究结果（如Nav1.7选择性体外/体内数据）、毒理学研究（急毒、长毒、遗传毒性、生殖毒性）、药代动力学动物数据及安全性药理学研究等来源方可形成实质正文。当前允许来源中无上述内容，章节当前正文为空，无法撰写任何有实质信息的非临床结果描述。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_58e6f365ebb1dbdd","section_number":"2.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:4e72f526af1f37fd2830b0d3","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_proto